# Test: the built le binary answers the RFC extraction envelope, audit
# accept-only: the registered native fixture enforces this scenario's behavioral contract
# re-seal, and requirement ledger over the real checkout. All five actions and
# every supported rendering are exercised through the developer-facing binary;
# the two writers run against isolated exports of HEAD.
#
# VALIDATES: spec-le-is-a-ze-binary AC-1, AC-7, AC-8 and AC-11 over the real
# tree and the artifact a developer runs.
#
# The timeout is declared because a cold build cache and the RFC tree walks are
# substantially slower than steady-state execution.

option=timeout:value=900s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze-test fixture ui/le-rfc-answers
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK
